{
  "name": "newamp",
  "version": "1.10.0",
  "description": "A Winamp-inspired modern desktop music player for macOS, Windows, and Linux. Your local library, your rules, no streaming required. Features Resonance — the whole UI reacts to your live audio — plus NewAmp Wrapped, a GPU particle visualizer + real MilkDrop, four UI shells, shape-changing deck skins, perceptual 0-200% volume, 0-100 decimal track scoring, and a magazine-style home. GPU-accelerated and tuned to stay light on weak hardware.",
